Third-party data
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Rail Delivery Group / Rail Settlement Plan (RDG/RSP) reference data
   Files: imports/rds_*.csv (stations, TOCs, ticket types, railcards, coords).
   These are derived from UK rail industry reference data and remain subject to
   the Rail Delivery Group's data-feed / open-data terms. They are included here
   for convenience and are not relicensed under MIT.

2. National Rail Darwin Push Port feed
   Consumed at runtime via the ingestion pipeline (not redistributed in this
   repo). The live data is provided under Network Rail's / National Rail's
   data-feed terms and remains subject to its own licence.

3. Station geodata
   Where station coordinates are sourced via the OpenStreetMap Overpass API
   (see scripts/seed_stations.py), that data is © OpenStreetMap contributors and
   licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL).

4. Trained model artefacts
   The ONNX model files under models/ are derived from operational UK rail delay
   data. They are distributed under MIT alongside the code, but the upstream data
   they were trained on remains subject to the terms in items 1–2 above.

